	(text "BASE v1.3.0 POWER UPGRADE - see POWER.md\nF1/D2 protect VBUS at the USB-C input; \n5V_SYS is tapped from protected VBUS (after F1, before FB1) through F2, D3 and 100uF/0.1uF bulk.\n12 x per-slot 2:1 power mux (U6..U17): shunt fitted -> 5V_SYS, open/lost -> +3.3V (100k pulldown). \nJ7..J18 sit hidden under a mated module: place them over the slot power rail, not in the ground/power gap. \nProtection hierarchy: F1 = 2A hold (input), F2 = 1.1A hold (5V branch), U5 own internal limit (3.3V branch). \nPer-slot current limit = 667mA nominal (R28, R30 ... R50 = 750R ILIM; R29, R31 ... R51 = 100k SEL pulldown, pulled to GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.788 385.318 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "55479a8a-0cd8-5219-a20f-6ec4e1e11d03")
	)
	(text "One sheet symbol = one instance of the slot template: supply + ground socket, TPS2111A 2:1\npower mux, 750R ILIM, 100k SEL pulldown, decoupling and the 1x02 rail-select header. Sheet pins\nVSLOT / SEL carry the per-slot rail and select nets (VSLOT_n / SEL_n) - the netlist is unchanged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.026 398.272 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "577a08af-f249-5679-ad32-d668d636d7ae")
	)
