		(property "Description" "Line-out stereo/mono selector (3-pad solder jumper, pads 1-2 bridged as shipped): pin1 = IN_R (stereo), pin2 = the right line amplifier input (R16), pin3 = BUFF_IN_L (mono). Cut the 1-2 bridge and bridge 2-3 for mono; in mono the right input IN_R no longer reaches the right line output."
			(at 67.31 377.19 0)
			(effects
